{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "946939bb-93f7-427a-903c-708f3a688382",
    "name": "Split Bill | Weekend Demo",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "# A weekend in Bandung\nAlice, Bob, and Cara record their shared expenses, then find out who owes whom.\n\n**Run the folders in order, starting with 01.** Use Send for a walkthrough or run the entire collection. IDs are captured automatically; no environment file is needed.\n\n- Start the API, then check the collection variable `base_url` (default: `http://localhost:4110`).\n- Keep Postman's cookie jar enabled. The group belongs to the session that creates it; do not switch between localhost and 127.0.0.1.\n- Each full run creates a fresh group. Avoid resending expense POST requests during one run, as each send adds another expense.\n- At the final request, open **Visualization / Visualize** for the presentation view.\n\n| Expense | Paid by | For | Amount (IDR) |\n| --- | --- | --- | ---: |\n| Lunch | Alice | Alice, Bob, Cara | 100,000.00 |\n| Taxi | Alice | Alice, Bob | 20,000.00 |\n| Tickets | Bob | Cara | 15,000.00 |\n\nExpected final total: **135,000.00 IDR**. Bob owes Alice **28,333.33**; Cara owes Alice **48,333.33**. The separate service charge is **6,750.00** for the default GitHub username (5%)."
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:4110",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "API address. Keep the same host throughout the demo."
    },
    {
      "key": "group_name",
      "value": "Bandung weekend",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Name used when creating the group."
    },
    {
      "key": "renamed_group_name",
      "value": "Bandung weekend - shared expenses",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Name used in the rename step."
    },
    {
      "key": "group_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Captured automatically. No manual editing needed."
    },
    {
      "key": "alice_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Captured automatically. No manual editing needed."
    },
    {
      "key": "bob_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Captured automatically. No manual editing needed."
    },
    {
      "key": "cara_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Captured automatically. No manual editing needed."
    },
    {
      "key": "lunch_expense_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Captured automatically. No manual editing needed."
    },
    {
      "key": "taxi_expense_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Captured automatically. No manual editing needed."
    },
    {
      "key": "tickets_expense_id",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Captured automatically. No manual editing needed."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 - Create the group",
      "description": "Set up the session-owned group and its participants.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "01 - Create the weekend group",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/bill-groups",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "bill-groups"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Create one group with three participants. The response saves group_id, and Postman keeps the session cookie.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{group_name}}\",\n  \"participants\": [\n    \"Alice\",\n    \"Bob\",\n    \"Cara\"\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "[\"group_id\", \"alice_id\", \"bob_id\", \"cara_id\", \"lunch_expense_id\", \"taxi_expense_id\", \"tickets_expense_id\"].forEach(key => pm.collectionVariables.unset(key));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 201\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const responseData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"group_id\", responseData.id);",
                  "pm.test(\"Group created in IDR\", () => pm.expect(responseData.currency).to.eql(\"IDR\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "02 - Get participants and save their IDs",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/bill-groups/{{group_id}}/participants",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "bill-groups",
                "{{group_id}}",
                "participants"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Capture Alice, Bob, and Cara IDs for the next requests."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const responseData = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    responseData.forEach(person => pm.collectionVariables.set(person.name.toLowerCase() + \"_id\", person.id));",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test(\"Three participants\", () => pm.expect(responseData.map(person => person.name)).to.eql([\"Alice\", \"Bob\", \"Cara\"]));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "03 - Read Alice's participant details",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/bill-groups/{{group_id}}/participants/{{alice_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "bill-groups",
                "{{group_id}}",
                "participants",
                "{{alice_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Read one participant using the captured ID."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const responseData = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"This is Alice\", () => pm.expect(responseData.name).to.eql(\"Alice\"));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "04 - Rename the group",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              },
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/bill-groups/{{group_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "bill-groups",
                "{{group_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Rename the group from the same owner session.",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{renamed_group_name}}\"\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const responseData = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"New name saved\", () => pm.expect(responseData.name).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"renamed_group_name\")));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "05 - Check the updated group",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Accept",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/bill-groups/{{group_id}}",
              "host": [
                "{{base_url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "bill-groups",
                "{{group_id}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Confirm the saved name and update timestamp."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"HTTP 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const responseData = pm.response.json();",
                  "",
                  "pm.test(\"Rename persisted\", () => pm.expect(responseData.name).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get(\"renamed_group_name\")));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "02 - Lunch for everyone",
      "description": "Alice pays 100,000.00 IDR. Equal shares: Alice 33,333.34, Bob 33,333.33, Cara 33,333.33.",
      "item": [
